# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ku_TR.dic — Kurmanci Dictionary Word List
# Kurdish Tech Organization | Open Source
#
# FORMAT: word[/flags]
#   Flags refer to SFX/PFX rules defined in ku_TR.aff
#   A = ezafe suffix | B = plural -an | H = nisbet -î
#   D = oblique | G = agentive | P = di- prefix
#
# LANGUAGE: Kurdish Kurmanci — 100% Latin alphabet
# NOTE: This is a STARTER vocabulary (~400+ core words).
#       Expand using the Ferheng.org dataset or CLTKurmanji corpus.
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Pronouns (Cînavk) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Common Nouns (Navdêr) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# --- Expanded Daily, Professional & Abstract Nouns ---

# ── Nature & Geography (Xweza û Erdnîgarî) ───────────────────────────────────

# ── Family (Malbat) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Body Parts (Endamên Laş) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Colours (Reng) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Numbers (Hejmar) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Days & Time (Roj û Wext) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Months (Meh) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Common Verbs — Infinitive & Stems ────────────────────────────────────────
# Full verb morphology is handled via PFX P (di-) and SFX E
# --- Expanded Verbs ---

# ── Adjectives (Rengdêr) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# --- Expanded Adjectives ---

# ── Adverbs (Hoker) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Prepositions & Particles ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Conjunctions (Girêker) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Proper Nouns — Places & Language ─────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Kurdish Culture & Identity ────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Technology Terms (Teknolojî) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# --- Expanded Technology & Science ---

# ── Education & Literature (Xwendin û Wêje) ──────────────────────────────────

# ── Health (Tendurustî) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Food & Drink (Xwarin û Vexwarin) ─────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Common Expressions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# END OF DICTIONARY
#
# HOW TO EXPAND THIS FILE:
#
# 1. FERHENG.ORG EXPORT:
#    Download the Kurmanci word list from https://ferheng.org
#    Format each line as: word[/FLAGS]
#
# 2. FREELANG / KURDISH NLP:
#    Contains ~30,000 lemmatised Kurmanci entries.
#
# 3. CLARIN KURDISH CORPUS:
#    Available through CLARIN's VLO for Northern Kurdish (kmr).
#
# 4. MANUAL REVIEW:
#    All entries MUST be verified by a native Kurmanci speaker.
#    Do NOT include Sorani, Badini, or Persian words.
#    Script is 100% Latin — NO Arabic script entries.
#
# Line format: word       → no affixes (exact match only)
#              word/ABH   → allows suffix rules A, B, H from ku_TR.aff
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════#
